From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yevhen Salitrynskyi <ysalitrynskyi@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 00:37:52 -0500
Subject: feat: the command bar's small leftovers

Enter in an empty bar opens the New Tab page, where it went to the tab
already on screen, so a page's override of the New Tab page applies from the
bar too; a row chosen with an arrow key still runs. Turn Bookmarks into Pinned
Tabs is listed only with something left to convert. A screen reader hears the
bar as a dialog with a name.

Why: BACKLOG S-158; docs/features/commandbar.md K16, K41, K42.

Removable when: never as a feature.
